# Optional AS3 (lab)

Minimal declaration shape for attaching the `malicious_user` iRule to a virtual server. Enable with `deploy.as3_enabled: true` and adapt pool/VIP for your lab.

```json
{
  "class": "AS3",
  "action": "deploy",
  "persist": true,
  "declaration": {
    "class": "ADC",
    "schemaVersion": "3.0.0",
    "id": "bigip-malicious-user-lab",
    "Lab": {
      "class": "Tenant",
      "App": {
        "class": "Application",
        "template": "http",
        "serviceMain": {
          "class": "Service_HTTP",
          "virtualAddresses": ["10.0.0.10"],
          "virtualPort": 80,
          "pool": "app_pool",
          "iRules": ["malicious_user"]
        },
        "app_pool": {
          "class": "Pool",
          "members": [
            {
              "servicePort": 8080,
              "serverAddresses": ["10.0.0.20"]
            }
          ]
        },
        "malicious_user": {
          "class": "iRule",
          "iRule": { "bigip": "/Common/malicious_user" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Prefer `scripts/deploy_rest.py` for iRule upload; use AS3 when you already manage the VS declaratively.
